# Commands
Commands are entered with : and are bounded to the current session.

## Common commands
@key :open URL       navigate to an HTTP(S) URL
@key :back           return to the previous page
@key :reload         reload the current page
@key :select CSS     count matching elements
@key :click CSS      perform a synthetic click
@key :set CSS VALUE  type into a control
@key :links          list redacted links
@key :urls FILE      save redacted links
@key :endpoints FILE export heuristic OpenAPI

- Search help:search
- Configuration help:config
